quot;,sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003eyou cannot be online: \u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e-Yes; I cannot be online\r\nmost weekdays from 6:00-3:00, I have a sleep schedule of 10:00 to 6:00, which\r\ncould be slightly altered if needed. There may be some days where I have other\r\nevents that I am unaware of, but mostly I will be able to make time.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003eDo you have experience in\r\nthe competitive community (Knowledge of strategies and maps), streaming,\r\ncommentating or analyzing:\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\